 "nodes": [
  {
   "nodeID": "2_168020248600860252",
   "text": "evidence that the courts and security services were aware of that Shamima Begum would pose a threat had the decision about taking her back in gone the wrong way",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "3_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: that had that decision gone the wrong way",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "5_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: that had that decision gone the wrong way",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "7_168020248600860252",
   "text": "there was some kind of threat in the UK",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "8_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: there was some kind of threat in the UK",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "10_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: there was some kind of threat in the UK",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "12_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "13_168020248600860252",
   "text": "the burden of the responsibility that he, Sajid Javid at the time, would\u2019ve felt would\u2019ve been enormous",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "14_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: the burden of the responsibility that he, Sajid Javid at the time, would\u2019ve felt would\u2019ve been enormous",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "16_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: the burden of the responsibility that he, Sajid Javid at the time, would\u2019ve felt would\u2019ve been enormous",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "19_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "21_168020248600860252",
   "text": "the national security and citizenships rights issues are very serious and finely balanced",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "22_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: these are very serious and finely balanced issues",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "24_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: these are very serious and finely balanced issues",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "30_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "33_168020248600860252",
   "text": " being a citizen is not just a question of rights",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "34_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng:  being a citizen is not just a question of rights",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "36_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng:  being a citizen is not just a question of rights",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "38_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "39_168020248600860252",
   "text": "being a citizen is also a question of responsibility",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "40_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: it is also a question of responsibility",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "42_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: it is also a question of responsibility",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "44_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "47_168020248600860252",
   "text": " we have seen clear instances, Anita Boateng thinks, from Shamima\u2019s behaviour that we know of that indicates that Shamima Begum is not behaving in the way that one would hope a citizen would",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "48_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng:  we have seen clear instances, I think, from Shamima\u2019s behaviour that we know of that indicates that she is not behaving in the way that one would hope a citizen would",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "50_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng:  we have seen clear instances, I think, from Shamima\u2019s behaviour that we know of that indicates that she is not behaving in the way that one would hope a citizen would",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "52_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "54_168020248600860252",
   "text": "there are instances where it is the right thing to do to take citizenship away when people have dual citizenship or acquired British citizenship",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "55_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: there are instances where it is the right thing to do to take citizenship away when people have dual citizenship or acquired British citizenship",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "57_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: there are instances where it is the right thing to do to take citizenship away when people have dual citizenship or acquired British citizenship",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "59_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "66_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "68_168020248600860252",
   "text": "the difficulty here is because she has this possible other citizenship, not as a result of her, but because her parents are of another origin",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "69_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: the difficulty here, as Liz says, is because she has this possible other citizenship, not as a result of her, but because her parents are of another origin",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "71_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: the difficulty here, as Liz says, is because she has this possible other citizenship, not as a result of her, but because her parents are of another origin",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "73_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "74_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Liz Saville Roberts: the difficulty here is because Shamima Begum has this possible other citizenship, not as a result of her, but because her parents are of another origin",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "76_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Liz Saville Roberts: the difficulty here, as Liz says, is because she has this possible other citizenship, not as a result of her, but because her parents are of another origin",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "80_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "82_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Shamima Begum's parents are Bangladeshi",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "83_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: they\u2019re Bangladeshi",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "85_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: they\u2019re Bangladeshi",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "87_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "90_168020248600860252",
   "text": "taking away the citizenship becomes a little more difficult",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "91_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: that becomes a little more difficult",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "93_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: that becomes a little more difficult",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "95_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "97_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "99_168020248600860252",
   "text": "decision about taking away the citizenship is a finely balanced thing",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "100_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: It\u2019s a finely balanced thing",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "102_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: It\u2019s a finely balanced thing",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "104_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "110_168020248600860252",
