   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "112_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng has a lot of sympathy with people who feel concerned",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "113_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: I have a lot of sympathy with people who feel concerned",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "115_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: I have a lot of sympathy with people who feel concerned",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "117_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "118_168020248600860252",
   "text": "the reality is that we've got to have a system where citizens are equal",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "119_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: the reality is that we've got to have a system where citizens are equal",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "121_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: the reality is that we've got to have a system where citizens are equal",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "123_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "124_168020248600860252",
   "text": "part of that means that certain citizens, that don\u2019t have heritage somewhere else or a relation somewhere else, wouldn't have the taking away the citizenship be a consequence",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "125_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anita Boateng: part of that means that certain citizens, that don\u2019t have heritage somewhere else or a relation somewhere else, wouldn't have this be a consequence",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "127_168020248600860252",
   "text": "Anon: Anita Boateng: part of that means that certain citizens, that don\u2019t have heritage somewhere else or a relation somewhere else, wouldn't have this be a consequence",
